{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"油麻地男賊持磚塊指嚇便利店女職員 掠數千元逃去。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/63b43030c2a27c47239f807d5ec17e7c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_32.jpeg\"/><p>油麻地發生行劫案。今日（19日）凌晨4時31分，一名男子闖入佐敦道9至11號高基大廈地下的一間便利店，並手持磚塊指嚇女店員，女店員其後從收銀機取出5000元交給對方，男賊得手後往加士居道方向逃去。</p><p>警員接報到場調查，案件列作「行劫」，暫未有人被捕。</p><img alt=\"便利店女職員被賊人以磚塊指嚇，警員到場調查事件。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/12c8caf465533e1b5312d32f89638515/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員接報到場調查事件。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e3ede6695467cdd94154972e41819b7c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"佐敦道9至11號高基大廈地下的一間便利店發生行劫案。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/08a000b87f767062ff3f0b0ebe3582c3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女職員在收銀機取出數千元現金，賊人得手後逃去。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/71cf105d5db33cfd0b8707a55a0040ef/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員接報到場調查事件。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3c91e8dc52b4fde53ccae57340b39886/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_34.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T00:38:33.108515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:54:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T01:37:44.256180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:37:45.317994+00:00","content_hash":"b43ff19bbe786dfc822d6309181ee2617112cbd8a1cc9bdee7d340c80edb578c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}